es/tag/mbedtls-3.6.4\r\n  * CVE-2025-49601\r\n  * CVE-2025-49600\r\n  * CVE-2025-52496\r\n  * CVE-2025-47917\r\n  * CVE-2025-48965\r\n  * CVE-2025-52497\r\n  * CVE-2025-49087\r\n  * Did not evaluate if any of those can be triggered from Godot / Godot projects, but we should update supported branches either way.\r\n  * @Faless / @lawnjelly: We're still on mbedTLS 2.28.10 on `3.x` / `3.6`, which was the previous LTS, but is now EOL. So notably we're missing this batch of security fixes, assuming some of those affect 2.28.10. So I would suggest looking into updating mbedTLS to 3.6.4 on `3.x` and `3.6` too.\r\n\r\n- Fixes #107754 (Arch users, please confirm).\r\n- Fixes #108048 (tested on Fedora 42 with GCC 15.1.1).\r\n\r\nThis part of the release notes seem to explain why we've had issues with custom builds of Godot with mbedTLS 3.6.3 on Arch and Fedora 42, both providing the latest GCC 15.\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/489aa152-5418-41ff-847d-55c6645ee7ab)\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":649800701,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw2NDk4MDA3MDE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:network","name":"topic:network","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","numb